    "title": "Garden of Eden - Natural Floral Solid Deodorant",
    "body_text": "Close your eyes. Now imagine a garden following you everywhere you go.\n\nGarden of Eden is a natural solid deodorant with a subtle, fresh frangipani fragrance — feminine without trying too hard. Made with magnesium hydroxide to neutralise odour at source and arrowroot powder to keep underarms dry, this is aluminium-free, baking soda-free, chemical-free personal care that genuinely works.\n\nNo pore-blocking compounds. No synthetic chemicals. No irritation. Just plant-based odour control that lets your skin breathe naturally all day.\n\nSuitable for all skin types including sensitive skin. Comes with a reusable wooden spatula in a recyclable tin.\n\n15g. Made in India.\n\nNatural colour and scent may vary slightly across batches — this is a feature, not a flaw. Always patch test before use\n\nShelf life: Use within 24 months of manufacture. Store in a cool, dry place\n\nRead more about our natural, eco-friendly deodorants here\n\nNote: While our deodorant effectively absorbs some moisture, it is not an antiperspirant\n\n--------------\n\nMRP: Rs.289/- incl. of all taxes (per unit)\n\nCaution: For external use only\n\nCountry of Origin: India\n\n--------------",
