    "body_html": "<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Close your eyes. Now imagine a garden following you everywhere you go.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Garden of Eden</strong> is a <strong>natural solid deodorant</strong> with a subtle, fresh frangipani fragrance — feminine without trying too hard. Made with <strong>magnesium hydroxide</strong> to neutralise odour at source and <strong>arrowroot powder</strong> to keep underarms dry, this is <strong>aluminium-free, baking soda-free, chemical-free</strong> personal care that genuinely works.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">No pore-blocking compounds. No synthetic chemicals. No irritation. Just <strong>plant-based odour control</strong> that lets your skin breathe naturally all day.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Suitable for <strong>all skin types including sensitive skin.</strong> Comes with a <strong>reusable wooden spatula</strong> in a recyclable tin.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>15g. Made in India.</strong></p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><em>Natural colour and scent may vary slightly across batches — this is a feature, not a flaw. Always patch test before use</em></p>\n<p><b>Shelf life:</b> Use within 24 months of manufacture. Store in a cool, dry place<strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br><br></span></strong><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Natural and eco-friendly underarm deodorants\" href=\"https://barenecessities.in/products/rock-n-roll-deodorant-earth-friendly-vegan-zero-waste-ecofriendly-natural\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #2b00ff; text-decoration: underline;\">Read more about our natural, eco-friendly deodorants here</span></span></a><br><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong>Note:</strong> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While our </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">deodorant</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> effectively absorbs some moisture, it is not an antiperspirant</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><b></b></span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\">--------------</p>\n<p><b>MRP:</b> Rs.289/- incl. of all taxes <meta charset=\"utf-8\">(per unit)</p>\n<p><strong>Caution: </strong>For external use only</p>\n<p><strong>Country of Origin:</strong> India</p>\n<p><b></b>--------------<br></p>",
